(CPU Scheduling) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The scheduler decides which ready process runs next on the CPU. Round robin gives each) Tj T*
(process a fixed time quantum and moves it to the back of the ready queue when the) Tj T*
(quantum expires. Shortest job first minimizes average waiting time but can starve long) Tj T*
(jobs. Starvation is a situation where a process waits indefinitely because other) Tj T*
(processes are always preferred.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
